    "description": "<p>You can call on your deity or pantheon to intervene on your behalf. As a Magic action, choose any Cleric spell of level 5 or lower that doesn't require a Reaction to cast. As part of the same action, you cast that spell without expending a spell slot or needing Material components. You can't use this feature again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section id=\"secret-LP7yqqobTjOqeswv\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Uncheck the \"Consumption\" box when casting the spell for the free use. This feature can be used to track available uses.</p></section>",
